---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';

---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Cookies | Helix Equine Vets"
  description="Our Cookies Policy"
>

<section class="prose-container">

<h1>Cookies Policy</h1>

<p>Headway Northumberland uses a minimal number of strictly necessary cookies to ensure site security and process payments safely. We do not use non-essential tracking, advertising, or marketing cookies.</p>
<p>Because we only use essential cookies, a consent banner pop-up is not required under UK data protection laws (PECR / UK GDPR).</p>

<h2>Essential Cookies Used</h2>

<h3>Cloudflare (cf_clearance)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Type:</strong> Strictly Necessary (Security)</li>
  <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> Distinguishes genuine human visitors from automated bots to protect the website against malicious traffic and cyber threats.</li>
  <li><strong>Duration:</strong> Up to 1 year</li>
</ul>

<h2>Managing Cookies</h2>
<p>While these cookies are necessary for the safe operation of our website, you can control or block cookies at any time through your browser settings. Please note that disabling essential cookies may prevent secure checkout and donation forms from functioning properly.</p>

</section>

</BaseLayout>